14
00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:59.070
As Alex mentioned, this is a modified third person template.

15
00:00:59.070 --> 00:01:04.469
Before we dive into all the blueprints here, let's just hit play and see what we have

16
00:01:04.469 --> 00:01:05.859
