17
00:01:05.859 --> 00:01:13.980
So once we hit play, we see we are in the normal third person template with some additional

18
00:01:13.980 --> 00:01:16.560
cubes and a pink bar here.

19
00:01:16.560 --> 00:01:22.280
So if we use right click to change the camera, we will see that the pink bar is

20
00:01:22.280 --> 00:01:25.140
