34
00:02:24.639 --> 00:02:28.800
And let's briefly look into sender and receiver.

35
00:02:28.800 --> 00:02:32.340
So on the sender side, these are all the nodes we have.

36
00:02:32.340 --> 00:02:37.840
We have event to send integers, send bool, and send float.

37
00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:42.800
And at the beginning play, we're going to specify if this app is a sender or not.

38
00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:46.840
